Targets: wasm
Releases: 9.3.0-12.22
Subject: Build wasm_popen.o into initdb
Purpose: The build file of initdb lists the object files; wasm_popen.o (patch 0220) has to be in the list. It is a patch of its own because the lines around the list differ from one series to the next: one variant per series. 9.2 has other lines around the list than 9.1, so it has its own variant (the one for 9.0 and 9.1 is capped at 9.1.24). This variant is for 9.3, where the object list of initdb has no pqsignal.o any more; the sibling for 9.2 is capped at 9.2.24.
Components: src/bin/initdb/Makefile
Checks: wasm/build.sh runs initdb under node and produces a data directory that postgres --single opens
Origin: own

diff --git a/src/bin/initdb/Makefile b/src/bin/initdb/Makefile
--- a/src/bin/initdb/Makefile
+++ b/src/bin/initdb/Makefile
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@
 override CPPFLAGS += '-DSYSTEMTZDIR="$(with_system_tzdata)"'
 endif
 
-OBJS=	initdb.o findtimezone.o localtime.o encnames.o $(WIN32RES)
+OBJS=	initdb.o findtimezone.o localtime.o encnames.o wasm_popen.o $(WIN32RES)
 
 all: initdb
 
